 בָּכָה ). 2 sport, play , Judg 16:27 . Pi`el Perfect 1singular וְשִׂחַקְתִּ֫י 1Sam 6:21 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular וַיְשַׂחֶקֿ Judg 16:25 , etc.; Infinitive construct לְשֵׂחֶקֿ Psa 104:26 ; Participle מְשַׂחֵק Prov 26:19 ; 1Chr 15:29 , feminine מְשֵׂחֶ֫קֶת Prov 8:30-31 , plural מְשַׂחֲקִים 2Sam 6:5 +, מְשַׂחֲקוֺת 1Sam 18:7 ; &#8212; 1 make sport , Judg 16:25 ( ל person) 2Sam 2:14 ( לִפְנֵי person; in tournament), Prov 8:30 ( לִפְנֵי ), 8:31 ב loc). 2 jest , Prov 26:19 . 3 play: including instrumental music, singing and dancing 1Sam 18:7 , c י ׳לִפְנֵי . 2Sam 6:5 ( ב instrumental), = 1Chr 13:8 ; 2Sam 6:21 ; 1Chr 15:29 ( + מְרַקֵּד ); of merry-making Jer 15:17 (|| עָלַז ), 30:19 ; 31:4 ; of children's sport Zech 8:5 ; of beasts Job 40:20 ; Psa 104:25 ; of man, play with ( ב ) crocod, Job 40:29. Hiph`il (declar.) Participle. plural מַשְׂחִיקִים 2Chr 30:10 they uttered mockery עֲלֵיהֶם (|| מַלְעִנִים ).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 13 8","keyReferences":["1Chr 13 8","1Chr 15 29","1Sam 18 7","2Chr 30 10","2Sam 2 14","2Sam 6 5","2Sam 6 21","Eccl 3 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 13 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְשַׂחֲקִ֛ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVprmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מְשַׂחֵ֔ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vprmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 7","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַֽ/מְשַׂחֲק֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vprfpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 30 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":30,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַשְׂחִיקִ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrmpa"},{"reference":"2Sam 2 14","book":"2Sam","chapter":2,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וִֽ/ישַׂחֲק֖וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpi3m